From 31dc65818dbb341c6ba199979a07e87891f84a21 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Mike Kinney <mike.kinney@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 19:35:21 -0800
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] fix(build): run independent release gate lanes in
 parallel

Prebuild both profiles, bound release waves to four lanes, and isolate
watchdog-containing crates and UI suites. Preserve separate lane logs,
checkout validation, and failed-build stopping.

Normalize unchanged Cargo.lock lines when checking version-only release
diffs so CRLF conversion does not reject a valid version bump.

Co-Authored-By: OpenAI Codex <noreply@openai.com>

Fixes #1703
